    (v_topic_id_10, 'stimulate', '/ˈstɪmjuleɪt/', '(v) kích thích, thúc đẩy', 'The new training programme is designed to stimulate employees to think creatively and solve problems independently.', 'Test 1', 0, 79, NOW() + interval '79 seconds'),
