    (v_topic_id_14, 'jump on the bandwagon', '/dʒʌmp ɒn ðə ˈbændwæɡən/', '(idiom) chạy theo phong trào / xu hướng', 'Leaders who blindly jump on the bandwagon without assessing their firm''s unique culture often experience unexpected operational failures.', 'Test 2', 1, 97, NOW() + interval '4297 seconds'),
