    (v_topic_id_17, 'epilogue', '/ˈepɪlɒɡ/', '(n) phần kết, lời bạt', 'In the book''s final epilogue, the author shifts focus to future urban planning policies and climate change challenges.', 'Test 3', 2, 92, NOW() + interval '7492 seconds'),
    (v_topic_id_17, 'grid system', '/ɡrɪd ˈsɪstəm/', '(n) hệ thống quy hoạch dạng bàn cờ', 'New York City''s early layout was heavily influenced by the adoption of a formal grid system in 1811.', 'Test 3', 2, 93, NOW() + interval '7493 seconds'),
