    (v_topic_id_18, 'Pass the emissions laws', '', 'Vượt qua các luật/quy định về khí thải', 'Even today, an unmodified Doble steam car can run clean enough to pass the emissions lawspass the emissions laws in California.', 'Test 3', 2, 70, NOW() + interval '8470 seconds'),
    (v_topic_id_18, 'In good working condition', '', 'Trong trạng thái hoạt động tốt', 'Many surviving Doble Model E cars are still in good working conditionin good working condition even after being driven over half a million miles. Compiled by CheeseNOTES 🧀', 'Test 3', 2, 71, NOW() + interval '8471 seconds'),
